## Programme

- 09:00 Coffee and welcome
- 09:20 Where the days go: a case from our [order-to-cash review](/projects/operations/order-to-cash-review/)
- 10:15 Map your own flow in small groups
- 11:30 Break
- 11:45 Find the three slowest steps
- 12:30 Plan your first changes
- 13:00 Lunch

## About the workshop

Most late payments start with a small problem early in the flow: a missing purchase order number, an unclear price or an invoice that waits for one signature. In this workshop you map the flow in your own company and mark where it waits.

The groups are small, and each group has a consultant at the table. Please bring a recent invoice, with the names removed, from an order that was paid late.

Seats are limited to 24. Tell us if you need a seat with step-free access.
